// The cases a function that has too few is offered: one line each, `(ARGS):
// (EXPECTED)`, with a name for every part the author has to supply -- an argument
// per parameter, and what the call must give. The names differ from line to line
// because two identical cases are an error of their own (check_dup_cases). A
// void function has no value to expect, so its line ends in `() then CHECK:
// (VALUE)`, the form docs/TESTS.md gives for checking an effect.

case_skeleton_edit(int dgn_row, int dgn_have) {
